# Release the extension > The gate
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/release-the-extension.md#L78
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

whole::a Take a version through the release ::e
gate::a Approve the release environment ::e --::P--> whole
publish::a Publish to the marketplaces ::e --::P--> whole
gate --> publish

rev::a Release reviewer --> gate
wf::a release workflow --> publish
draft::a the draft release --> gate, publish
sums::a SHA256SUMS --> gate
approval::a the required review --> gate

rev --> Reviewer ::c
wf --> CI check ::c
draft --> output ::c
sums --> output ::c
approval --> gated approval ::c
